    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You silence manipulation mid-note.</em></p><p>When a creature within <strong>12 squares</strong> uses a deceit-based tactic—such as imposing a keep-lowest roll through misinformation, illusions, fear propaganda, or a charm-adjacent mental effect—you may use your <strong>reaction</strong> to nullify that interference.</p><ul><li>The imposed penalty or forced reroll is <strong>canceled</strong>.</li><li>You can use this feature <strong>once per Soma Break</strong>.</li></ul><p>In Bad Eden terms: you jam the signal.</p>",
